[{"id":2578845568,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Ztg-A","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","login":"kiroxas","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas"},"body":"Early return and slightly less look ups are fine !\r\nShould be good to test the override path as well in a test, as it is where you changed most of the code.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102126#pullrequestreview-2578845568","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102126","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-01-28T16:39:48Z"},{"id":2579046888,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZuSHo","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test-projectsettings.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18577512/test-projectsettings.zip)\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** Intel Core i9-13900K\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-5800 C30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Windows 11 24H2\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nUsing a release export template compiled with MSVC 2022. The improvement is mostly seen in `get_setting_with_override()`; `get_setting()` is essentially unaffected.\r\n\r\n### Before\r\n\r\n```\r\nProjectSettings.get_setting(): 364800 usec for 2500000 iterations\r\nProjectSettings.get_setting_with_override(): 436951 usec for 2500000 iterations\r\n```\r\n\r\n### After\r\n\r\n```\r\nProjectSettings.get_setting(): 361875 usec for 2500000 iterations\r\nProjectSettings.get_setting_with_override(): 390053 usec for 2500000 iterations\r\n```","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102126#pullrequestreview-2579046888","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102126","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-01-28T18:00:01Z"},{"id":2579065355,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZuWoL","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102126#pullrequestreview-2579065355","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102126","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-01-28T18:08:10Z"},{"id":2579160442,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Zut16","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","login":"kiroxas","type":"User","owned_pr